---
/**
 * Mount point for the post-signup onboarding checklist (★ favorite 3 tools →
 * 🔔 follow 1 tool → 🤖 get your badge).
 *
 * The card itself is rendered client-side by /dist/onboarding.js once the
 * session, /api/onboarding state, and the shared favorite/follow stores are
 * ready. It stays hidden for signed-out, dismissed, or already-activated
 * visitors, so it is safe to include on any dashboard page.
 */
---

<div id="onboardingChecklist" class="hidden mb-7" role="region" aria-label="Account setup"></div>
